DTSTAMP:20261104T202843Z
DTSTART:20261128T190000Z
DTEND:20261128T205900Z
SUMMARY:Youve Got Mail (1998)
LOCATION:Moreland Theater\, 6712 SE Milwaukie Ave\, Portland OR
GEO:45.4752;-122.6504
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Nora Ephron · 119 min\n\nBook superstore magnate Joe Fox 
 and independent book shop owner Kathleen Kelly fall in love in the anonymi
 ty of the Internet—both blissfully unaware that he's trying to put her o
 ut of business.\n\nTickets: https://morelandtheater.com/tickets/\n\nMore s
 howtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
URL:https://morelandtheater.com/tickets/
END:VEVENT
